msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We can make it this far on the white men’s ship,⟪k:1⟫but they give no response to our "
"missives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫“紅毛人”の船でここまでは来るものの――、⟪k:1⟫書状を渡そうが何の返答もない。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_89BC95E5_6290_4EA9_B34E_AD4239D284B9
